---
import {catalogue,indexBase} from '../../../data/nuwa-index';
import {localizedPath,type Locale} from '../../../i18n/config';
import supplementalBrands from '../../../data/nuwa-index/model-developer-brands.json';
import {resolveDeveloper} from '../../../lib/modelBrandIdentity.mjs';
import OrganizationMark from './OrganizationMark.astro';
interface Props {locale:Locale}
const {locale}=Astro.props,en=locale==='en';
const sections=en?['Sources','Collection','Synthesis','Comparison','Limitations','Acknowledgements','Versions']:['来源','数据采集','证据汇总','比较方法','局限','致谢','版本记录'];
const ids=['sources','collection','synthesis','comparison','limitations','acknowledgements','versions'];
const contributorIds=new Set(catalogue.works.flatMap(w=>w.contributions.map(co=>co.organizationId)));
const executorIds=new Set(catalogue.assessmentEvidence?.flatMap(e=>[...(e.executorIds??[]),...(e.originalExecutorIds??[])])??[]);
const developerIds=new Set([...(catalogue.models?.map(m=>m.developerId)??[]),...catalogue.results.flatMap(r=>{const d=resolveDeveloper(r.system,catalogue);return d?[d.organizationId]:[];})]);
const allOrganizations=[...catalogue.organizations,...supplementalBrands.organizations.map(o=>({id:o.organizationId,name:{en:o.displayName,zh:o.displayName},homepage:o.officialHomepage}))];
const organizations=allOrganizations.filter(o=>contributorIds.has(o.id)||executorIds.has(o.id)||developerIds.has(o.id));
const categories=[{title:en?'Model disclosures':'模型披露',items:organizations.filter(o=>developerIds.has(o.id))},{title:en?'Research and evaluation':'研究与评测',items:organizations.filter(o=>!developerIds.has(o.id))}];
const path=(tail='')=>localizedPath(`${indexBase}${tail}`,locale);
---
<div class="nw-methodology" data-methodology-content>
 <header><h2>{en?'How NUWA assembles the evidence':'NUWA 如何汇集与分析证据'}</h2><p>{en?'NUWA Index connects published research, model disclosures and evaluation results. NUWA maintains the catalogue, reconciles measurement conditions and develops research interpretations; experiments remain attributed to their original evaluators.':'NUWA Index 汇集公开研究、模型披露与测评结果。女娲负责维护目录、核对测量条件并开展研究分析，实验成果归属于原始评测团队。'}</p></header>
 <div class="nw-method-layout"><nav aria-label={en?'Methodology contents':'方法目录'}>{sections.map((title,i)=><a href={`#method-${ids[i]}`}>{title}</a>)}</nav><div class="nw-method-body">
 <section id="method-sources"><h3>{sections[0]}</h3><p>{en?'The catalogue includes original papers, system cards, model cards, third-party assessments, official benchmark data, technical articles and incident investigations. An identifiable source, a clear research question and an account of the method determine inclusion. Scores and open code are useful resources, rather than admission requirements.':'目录收录原始论文、系统卡、模型卡、第三方评估、基准官方数据、技术文章及事件调查。收录依据是可识别的来源、明确的研究问题和可说明的方法；公开分数或开源代码并非必要条件。'}</p><p>{en?'Each record distinguishes the model developer, report publisher and actual evaluator. A report that quotes another team’s experiment retains that team as the experimental source. Research is organized as risk discovery, risk evaluation and risk governance; tags describe more specific methods and phenomena.':'每条记录分别标注模型开发者、报告发布者和实际评测者。转引其他团队实验的报告保留原始执行方署名。研究按风险发现、风险评测、风险治理组织，更具体的方法与现象通过标签检索。'}</p></section>
 <section id="method-collection"><h3>{sections[1]}</h3><p>{en?'Source-specific extraction records the reported value, unit, qualifier, sample, task scope, model endpoint, harness, budget and source location. Independent review checks these fields against the captured document. Source versions and review records bind the extraction to the material actually inspected.':'按来源提取原始数值、单位、限定语、样本、任务范围、模型端点、Harness、预算及原文位置，并对照取得的文档复核。来源版本与复核记录将提取结果绑定到实际查阅的材料。'}</p><p>{en?'Model release dates and disclosed parameter counts are maintained in a separate registry using developer sources. Experiment dates, report publication dates and NUWA collection dates remain separate. Missing fields remain identifiable throughout charts, tables and exports.':'模型发布时间和已披露参数规模由独立登记表依据开发者来源维护。实验日期、报告公开日期及 NUWA 收录日期分别记录，缺失字段在图表、表格与导出中保持可辨。'}</p></section>
 <section id="method-synthesis"><h3>{sections[2]}</h3><p>{en?'Results are linked through benchmark identity, protocol version, metric and system configuration. HTML, PDF and identifier links to the same publication share one bibliography entry. Reused measurements retain every source location while counting as one experiment only when their identity has been established. Independent repetitions remain separate observations.':'结果按 Benchmark 身份、协议版本、指标及系统配置建立关联。同一成果的网页、PDF 和文献标识共用一个参考文献条目。确认身份相同的转引测量合并实验身份并保留全部出处，独立重复测量仍分别保留。'}</p><p>{en?'Cross-report views retain task subsets, scoring denominators, attempt rules and budget differences. Source-reported values are stored separately from NUWA interpretation and documented arithmetic conversions.':'跨报告视图保留任务子集、计分分母、尝试规则和预算差异，原文结果、NUWA 解读及有计算依据的单位转换分别维护。'}</p></section>
 <section id="method-comparison"><h3>{sections[3]}</h3><p>{en?'A shared benchmark name does not establish a common protocol. Reviewed matching conditions support direct comparison; known configuration differences support descriptive views. Values with incomplete conditions remain visible as supplementary observations. Distinct task scopes appear in separate panels, and stable longitudinal series alone receive connecting lines.':'同名 Benchmark 的实际协议可能不同。经审查的匹配条件支持直接比较，配置差异明确的结果用于描述性并列，条件不完整的数值作为补充观测保留。不同任务范围分别成图，稳定的纵向系列才连接趋势线。'}</p><p>{en?'Trend charts use independently sourced model release dates. Retrospective views incorporate evidence available today; historical-cutoff views include only reports public at that time. Marker shape identifies comparison conditions, and developer color identifies the model organization. Uncertainty intervals, thresholds and zero values retain their original meaning.':'趋势图使用独立核验的模型发布日期。当前证据回溯使用现有材料，历史截止视图只包含当时已公开的报告。点形表示比较条件，机构颜色用于辨认模型开发者；区间、阈值和零值保留原始含义。'}</p><span id="indicator-register"></span><h4>{en?'Indicator selection':'指标遴选'}</h4><p>{en?'Monitoring indicators are selected for risk relevance, measurement validity, coverage, continuity and protocol transparency. Capability, propensity and observed behavior remain distinct measurements. Benchmark pages document the source protocols and conditions used in each result.':'监测指标依据风险关联、测量有效性、模型覆盖、连续性和协议透明度选择。能力、倾向和实际行为保持各自测量含义，每个 Benchmark 页面集中记录来源协议和结果条件。'}</p><div class="nw-method-resources"><a href={path('/snapshot.json')} download>{en?'Data snapshot':'数据快照'} ↓</a><a href={path('/results.csv')} download>CSV ↓</a></div></section>
 <section id="method-limitations"><h3>{sections[4]}</h3><p>{en?'Published evidence reflects selective disclosure and uneven model coverage. Task leakage, saturation, scoring changes and inaccessible configurations can affect interpretation. A missing result records a coverage gap; an observed zero is a measured outcome under a specified test. Knowledge tests, task completion and deployment incidents answer different questions.':'公开证据受到选择性披露和模型覆盖不均的影响，任务泄漏、饱和、计分变化和配置不可获取也会影响解释。结果缺失体现覆盖缺口，零值则是特定测试下的实际观测。知识测验、任务完成和部署事件回答不同问题。'}</p><p>{en?'Benchmark scores describe performance under their tested conditions. NUWA does not add heterogeneous scores into a single safety grade or infer real-world event probabilities from them. Research interpretations identify the evidence they use and are revised when underlying records change.':'Benchmark 分数描述测试条件下的表现。NUWA 不将异质分数相加为统一安全等级，也不由此推算现实事件概率。研究分析注明所依据的证据，并随底层记录变化修订。'}</p></section>
 <section id="method-acknowledgements"><h3>{sections[5]}</h3><p>{en?'We acknowledge the researchers and teams whose publications, disclosures and evaluation resources make this knowledge base possible. The organizations below are credited through the works and assessments recorded in NUWA Index.':'感谢全球研究者与团队公开研究成果、模型披露及评测资源，为知识库提供基础。以下机构依据 NUWA Index 已记录的作品与评估署名列示。'}</p>{categories.map(category=><div class="nw-ack-group"><h4>{category.title}</h4><div class="nw-ack-list">{category.items.sort((a,b)=>a.name[locale].localeCompare(b.name[locale])).map(o=>o.homepage?<a href={o.homepage} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><OrganizationMark organizationId={o.id} locale={locale}/></a>:<OrganizationMark organizationId={o.id} locale={locale}/>)}</div></div>)}</section>
 <section id="method-versions"><h3>{sections[6]}</h3><p>{en?'Current evidence snapshot':'当前证据快照'}: <strong>{catalogue.snapshotId}</strong> · {en?'Coverage cutoff':'检索截止'}: {catalogue.coverageAudit.cutoff}</p><p>{en?'The current release establishes cross-report measurement links and records protocol corrections. Historical additions are classified as coverage updates. Corrections remain attached to the affected result records and preserved snapshots.':'当前版本补充跨报告测量关联并记录协议更正。补录历史材料归为覆盖更新，更正保留在受影响的结果记录与历史快照中。'}</p><ul>{catalogue.monitoring?.resultCorrections.map(c=><li><a href={path(`/result/${c.resultId}`)}>{catalogue.results.find(r=>r.id===c.resultId)?.system??c.resultId}</a>: {c.reason[locale]}</li>)}</ul></section>
 </div></div>
</div>
<style>
.nw-methodology{max-width:1120px;padding:16px 0 40px}.nw-methodology header{max-width:780px;margin-bottom:32px}.nw-methodology h2{font-size:28px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0 0 14px}.nw-methodology p,.nw-methodology li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#3f555e}.nw-method-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px minmax(0,1fr);gap:44px}.nw-method-layout>nav{align-self:start;position:sticky;top:110px;display:grid;gap:12px;font-size:13px}.nw-method-layout>nav a{color:#306555}.nw-method-body{min-width:0;max-width:850px}.nw-method-body section{scroll-margin-top:110px;margin:0 0 38px}.nw-method-body h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 14px}.nw-method-body h4{font-size:16px;margin:22px 0 12px}.nw-method-body p{margin:0 0 14px}.nw-method-resources{display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:13px}.nw-ack-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 24px}.nw-ack-list>a{font-size:13px;max-width:100%;text-decoration:none;color:#294d52}.nw-ack-group{margin:22px 0}.nw-ack-list :global(.organization-mark){font-size:13px}@media(max-width:900px){.nw-method-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.nw-method-layout>nav{position:static;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 20px}.nw-methodology h2{font-size:25px}}
</style>
